~[Iicon.6]<h2>**Simulation**</h2>~[Ithundercannon.A10]
<i>"Practice always makes perfect (Unless you really suck)"<br></i>
--R3K2 The Menacer Robot~[Iicon.5]
<p>In this mission you are in a simulation prototype designed specifically for practice.  Your ally here is General Thunder (Do not dissapoint him),you two are going up against Luitenent of wind and Sarge. You are training for the battle of the millenium, you will need all the practice you can get.  

$Button=EQUIPMENT,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=ENGAGE,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Nice stuff.</h2>
<p>
Congrats.  Seems you are ready for the war, well, all we have to do now is prepare...

